        <qualifiedname>endstone::ComplexAliasIngredient::getAlias</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Gets the alias that this ingredient will match. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The id predates the item flattening, such as <computeroutput>minecraft:planks</computeroutput>, and stands for every item it was split into. It is not an item tag, and the items are not reported.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>the alias </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
